// "Falaises Flanelle": cliffs at sunset (issue #110, the 10th circuit), after the guide
// « Conception des circuits » (docs/GAME_DESIGN.md § 16). Original layout, about 1530 m a lap,
// turning left: the start straight on the cliff top, 36 m up (issue #221; 14 m before); two
// hairpins (left, right) down it, in anti-gravity between them, to the risky jump's corner on the
// edge, 19 m up (a tight corner to the left, its inside a drop, that a ramp crosses); along the
// edge to the glide ramp, and the glide down to the foot of the cliff; the snake back up (a hairpin
// to the left, a drop, one to the right, two tight turns, a hairpin to the right, two tight turns;
// issue #221: up to the cliff top, its steep legs in anti-gravity); the bulge round a giant needle
// of white stone, whose hidden road runs straight behind a stack of crates; the last corner, that
// the grass bridge crosses behind a panel that breaks under a boost. Five hairpins of 180° (a
// Normal bot drifts them), the bulge's S (left 150° between two right 75°), tight corners of 90°:
// no long soft curve, one long straight. The pieces of the shortcuts (the jump's corner, its
// landing and the glide; the bulge, the last corner and their paths) are the Corniche Cannelle's,
// mirrored (issues #107, #156: their gains and their hiding were tuned), with other covers; the
// rest is new.
//
// Drawn as a plan of straights and arcs, its points every 8 m along it (the parameters below
// follow them).
//
// Format: see src/track/data.rs. Point 0 is the start line; karts drive toward point 1 (north,
// -Z), then turn left. The grid sits on the straight behind point 0.
(
    name: "Falaises Flanelle",
    // Dressing (issue #11): the cliffs at sunset (`assets/data/biomes.ron`), the same every time
    // (seed), and pieces placed by hand: checkered flags at the start line, a giant needle of
    // white stone that hides the hidden road, another one by the jump's corner.
    biome: "Falaises",
    // Issue #104: its music (`assets/data/music.ron`).
    music: "darkness-road",
    decor_seed: 1010,
    // Issue #211: the cliffs' terrain (`assets/data/biomes.ron`), and it hugs the road: the cliff
    // top, 14 m up, and the snake back up from its foot are carried by the chalk up to their walls,
    // which falls away from them (`embank`, rise over run: about 31°), instead of the skirts down
    // to the heath. The voids stay (the jump's corner, the glide's drop: 6 m under the road at
    // least, 16 m beyond the walls). Issue #221: the start straight at 36 m (14 m before), down to
    // the edge (19 m: the glide and its foot 5 m higher, the same drop), and the snake back up.
    terrain: (height: 66.0, scale: 160.0, cliffs: 0.7, terrace: 16.0, floor: 0.2,
              rock: (0.86, 0.82, 0.78), steep: 0.8, embank: 0.6),
    props: [
        (model: "racing-kit/flagCheckers", at: 0.0, side: Both, height: 4.0, radius: 0.9, gap: 1.8),
        (model: "nature-kit/stone_tallI", at: 166.216, side: Left, height: 22.0, radius: 3.8, gap: 8.0),
        (model: "nature-kit/stone_tallF", at: 49.204, side: Right, height: 24.0, radius: 6.0, gap: 2.0),
    ],
    checkpoint_spacing: 25.0,
    points: [
